Description: Sanitizer denylists may name files the source package leaves out
 The source package keeps only the xnu files the build reads, and the
 denylists also name files of other architectures. validate_denylist.sh
 now reports a denylisted file that is missing without failing.
Author: The Blueberry Pie OS Authors
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-07

--- a/xnu/san/tools/validate_denylist.sh
+++ b/xnu/san/tools/validate_denylist.sh
@@ -1,4 +1,21 @@
 #!/bin/bash
+# Modified 2026-11-01: a missing file is reported without failing (APSL 2.0 section 2.2(b)).
